# LeakSanitizer suppressions for MFTL tests.
#
# MPICH keeps small internal bookkeeping allocations alive for the duration
# of the process (communicator/context registration caches released only at
# MPI teardown). These are not MFTL leaks; every allocation reported under
# these patterns has its origin frame inside libmpi.
leak:libmpi.so*
leak:libmpich.so*
leak:libmpl.so*
